  "releaseNotes": "Parsing and writing rebuilt on a shared scanner. Single-line quoted values now parse. WriteValue updates an existing key in place instead of doing nothing. Comments, ordering, indentation, encoding and line endings survive a write. All parsing and formatting is culture invariant. WriteToFile is public, errors carry line numbers, and saves are atomic.",
